{"id":"n62311-1-8","stage":1,"title":"서두르다 · 着急","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62311-1-8-1","ko":"시간 없어. 빨리 가자.","zh":"我没时间了，我们快走吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시간","meaning":"时间，空儿","explanation":"시간：时间，空儿","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"3","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"4","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가자.","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间，空儿","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"做某事的空闲。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"某物不多。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"a5443c04aa0fdc08","term":"빨리","zh":"快，赶快","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3","entryId":"57305","definition":"花费的时间不长地。","pronunciation":["빨리"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6306c5aa4159483dd39d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62311-1-8-2","ko":"아직 조금 여유가 있으니 너무 서두르지 마.","zh":"还有点时间，别太着急。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조금","meaning":"片刻，一会儿","explanation":"조금：片刻，一会儿","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"2","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여유가","meaning":"宽裕，闲暇","explanation":"여유：宽裕，闲暇；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"여유","audio":"/audio/6652674430e5064bcf87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67787","senseId":"1","lemma":"여유","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있으니","meaning":"富有，宽裕","explanation":"있다：富有，宽裕；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"4","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서두르지","meaning":"着急，操之过急","explanation":"서두르다：着急，操之过急；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"서두르다","audio":"/audio/46ed6fddc77dbc72dcc7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62311","senseId":"1","lemma":"서두르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마.","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"片刻，一会儿","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"短暂时间。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"6652674430e5064b","term":"여유","zh":"宽裕，闲暇","audio":"/audio/6652674430e5064bcf87.mp3","entryId":"67787","definition":"时间、空间、金钱等充裕且有剩余的状态。","pronunciation":["여유"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"富有，宽裕","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"财产充足、充裕。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"46ed6fddc77dbc72","term":"서두르다","zh":"着急，操之过急","audio":"/audio/46ed6fddc77dbc72dcc7.mp3","entryId":"62311","definition":"为了快点做某事而不沉着、忙于行动。","pronunciation":["서두르다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c3a08aaf0ffbdbddb766.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.127,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62311","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":39,"sequenceScore":1.7804,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我没时间了，我们快走吧。","还有点时间，别太着急。","亲爱的，汤好像有点淡哦。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我没时间了，我们快走吧。","还有点时间，别太着急。","亲爱的，汤好像有点淡哦。"],"answer":1}]}
